FortyFifthMidi — licensing
==========================

This project is MIT licensed. It builds against the DISTRHO Plugin Framework
(DPF), which is not part of this repository and carries its own terms, so a
BUILT plugin combines both. The summary below says which applies to what.

Short version: everything here is permissive. No copyleft, no commercial
restriction, in any configuration this project builds. Attribution is the
only obligation.


1. This project's own code — MIT
--------------------------------

Everything tracked in this repository:

    src/            the plugin itself
    dev/            build scripts and tests
    docs/           specification and notes
    .devcontainer/  development environment
    Makefile

